# sweep: --bare
# Honest first-run: the shelf is empty until the host CLI pushes photos.
expect Frame
wait-for Your frame is empty
expect kobo frame
expect Check for photos
clean
shot empty
# Checking with nothing pushed keeps the same empty page.
tap Check for photos
wait-idle
wait-for Your frame is empty
# Settings are in the bar even before there is a photo.
tap Settings
wait-for Change the photo every
expect Frame mode
tap Back
wait-for Your frame is empty
# After a push, Check for photos brings the photo up without leaving Frame.
companion frame push scripts/fixtures/frame/lighthouse.jpg --sim
tap Check for photos
wait-for-id next
wait-idle
expect-missing Your frame is empty
clean
shot empty-then-photo
